<title>USA: Hanover Foods 9 month net rises.</title>
<headline>Hanover Foods 9 month net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Pa. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hanover Foods Corp said its net income for the first nine months of its 1997 fiscal year increased to $5.0 million from $1.3 million last year.</p>
<p>The year-to-dater period ended March 2.</p>
<p>As projected, sales for the first nine months of the fiscal year were $190.9 million compared to $196.9 million last year. The company said that as planned, there will be positive long term growth for stockholders due to new products, possible acquisitions and increased sales.</p>
</text>
